    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temp Converter</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #1a1c2c;\n      --card: #2d2f3b;\n      --text: #f4f4f4;\n      --accent: #ffcd75;\n      --accent-dark: #e6b800;\n      --border: #5a5c6e;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body {\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      padding: 16px;\n      image-rendering: pixelated;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: var(--card);\n      border: 4px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 0;\n      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0d0e14;\n      padding: 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 420px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 0.875rem;\n      color: #a0a2b0;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    label {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.9375rem;\n    }\n    input, select, button {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 12px;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      border: 3px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 0;\n      background: #1f2130;\n      color: var(--text);\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: border-color 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n    }\n    input:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);\n    }\n    input:hover, select:hover {\n      border-color: #7a7c8e;\n    }\n    button {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #1a1c2c;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border-color: var(--accent-dark);\n      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0d0e14;\n      transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n    }\n    button:hover {\n      background: var(--accent-dark);\n    }\n    button:active {\n      transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n      box-shadow: none;\n    }\n    .output-label {\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.9375rem;\n    }\n    #result {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 16px;\n      font-size: 1.75rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: #1f2130;\n      border: 3px solid var(--border);\n      color: var(--accent);\n      min-height: 64px;\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n    .formula {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      font-size: 0.8125rem;\n      color: #a0a2b0;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n    .formula code {\n      background: #1f2130;\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      font-size: 0.8125rem;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 400px) {\n      .card { padding: 16px; }\n      h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }\n      #result { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Celsius ⇄ Fahrenheit</p>\n\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"decimal\">\n\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n\n    <div class=\"output-label\">Result</div>\n    <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">--</output>\n\n    <div class=\"formula\">\n      <code>°C → °F: x × 9/5 + 32</code><br>\n      <code>°F → °C: (x − 32) × 5/9</code>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\n  const directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\n  const convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\n  const resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function convert() {\n    const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n    if (raw === '') {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    const num = Number(raw);\n    if (!Number.isFinite(num)) {\n      resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    let converted;\n    if (directionSelect.value === 'c-to-f') {\n      converted = num * 9 / 5 + 32;\n    } else {\n      converted = (num - 32) * 5 / 9;\n    }\n    resultEl.textContent = converted.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  convertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\n  tempInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Temperature Converter\n\nA fully offline, pixel-styled temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage, no external assets.\n\n## Features\n\n- Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit and Fahrenheit to Celsius\n- Pixel-art inspired UI with a cohesive 3–5 color palette\n- Keyboard accessible: labeled controls, focus states, Enter key support\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n- Outputs numeric value with exactly two decimals (no units)\n- Shows exactly `Error` for empty, invalid, or non-finite input\n\n## Formulas\n\n- **Celsius → Fahrenheit:** `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- **Fahrenheit → Celsius:** `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Controls\n\n| ID | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `temperature` | text input | Temperature value to convert |\n| `direction` | select | `c-to-f` or `f-to-c` |\n| `convert` | button | Triggers conversion |\n| `result` | output | Shows result, initially `--` |\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature (e.g., `100`).\n3. Choose a direction (Celsius → Fahrenheit or Fahrenheit → Celsius).\n4. Click **Convert** or press Enter in the input field.\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimal places, without units.\n\n## Error Handling\n\nEmpty input, non-numeric text, whitespace-only, `Infinity`, and `NaN` all produce the exact output `Error`.\n\n## Testing Examples\n\n- `0` °C → `32.00`\n- `100` °C → `212.00`\n- `32` °F → `0.00`\n- `-40` °C → `-40.00`\n- `-40` °F → `-40.00`\n- Empty → `Error`\n- `abc` → `Error`\n- `Infinity` → `Error`\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and styles\n- `script.js` — conversion logic\n- `README.md` — this file\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
